Decided on this outfit!

156
00:21:17,435 --> 00:21:27,475
お着替えタ～イム！よいしょー！ぱー！
Outfit change ti～me! Yoisho! Pa!

157
00:21:34,665 --> 00:21:36,785
大和撫子エデュケイション！
Yamato Nadeshiko Education!

158
