順序をかれんであれ、潤わしき心得を心胸に刻んで
With graceful order, engrave refined knowledge in your heart

160
00:21:50,135 --> 00:21:53,125
グッと胸に刻んで
Engrave it firmly in your chest

161
00:21:55,135 --> 00:21:58,265
前髪数寸の丈 高速重油しましょう
Bangs a few inches long, let's accelerate heavy oil

162
