みんなもっと もっと 美しくあれ 真っすぐに 進みましょう
Everyone, more, more, be beautiful, let's move forward straight ahead

167
00:22:44,365 --> 00:22:49,085
Let's Go! どんどん Boy!
Let's Go! Come on, Boy!

168
00:22:50,456 --> 00:22:55,236
生徒手帳の中の 思想落ちてゆくのです なんて理想的なサイン
Ideology falling out of the student handbook, what an ideal sign

169
00:23:01,116 --> 00:23:06,646
学びは温故知新 心差しを磨くべく 今日も張り切らなくちゃ
Learning is honoring the old to know the new, to polish our aspirations, we gotta work hard today too

170
00:23:11,246 --> 00:23:17,436
有意義にだけど厳しく 成長の過程は じゅっちょこちょっちょしなくたって自分のルールで
Meaningful yet strict, the process of growth, even without hesitating, following your own rules

171
00:23:23,876 --> 00:23:32,466
ドンピシャリ 心らしく 流されたりしないよ ゆっくりと 咲かせましょう 記憶正しく
Spot on! Living true to heart, never getting swept away, let's bloom slowly, with righteous memories

172
