凛々です 一番の 味方は自分自身 みんなもっと もっと 美しくあれ 真っすぐに 進みましょう
Being gallant, your greatest ally is yourself, everyone, more, more, be beautiful, let's move forward straight ahead

173
00:23:50,056 --> 00:24:00,716
急げ急げ！一期一会！自問自答！度胸！度胸！No.1！Number One！お互い頑張れボーイ！Let's go, Ganbare Boy!
Hurry hurry! Once-in-a-lifetime meeting! Soul searching! Courage! Courage! Number One! Number One! Hang in there, boys! Let's go, Ganbare Boy!

174
