176
00:24:39,046 --> 00:24:50,046
急げ急げ！一期一会！自問自答！度胸！度胸！No.1！Number One！お互い頑張れボーイ！
Hurry hurry! Once-in-a-lifetime meeting! Soul searching! Courage! Courage! Number One! Number One! Hang in there, boys!

177
00:25:04,047 --> 00:25:10,887
水着のねねたちどうだった？次はどんな曲で、どんな衣装かなぁ。
How did you like the swimsuit Nene's? What song and outfit should we do next?

178
00:25:12,207 --> 00:25:16,027
このへんで落ち着いた曲もいいかもね。
A calm song around here might be nice too.

179
00:25:16,987 --> 00:25:19,987
おっけー！この曲に決定！
Okay! Deciding on this song!

180
00:25:21,919 --> 00:25:24,559
次はどの衣装で歌おうかなぁ。
Which outfit should I sing in next?

181
00:25:26,639 --> 00:25:29,939
ちょっと落ち着いた感じがいいな。
Something a little calmer would be nice.

182
00:25:31,079 --> 00:25:43,859
この服……うーん、ちょっと違うかな。あの服？いやいや、もっと落ち着いた感じの衣裳……うーん、あっ！この衣裳で、決定ー！
This outfit... hmm, maybe a little different. That outfit? No no, an outfit with a calmer vibe... hmm, ah! Deciding on this outfit!

183
00:25:44,299 --> 00:25:53,739
よろしくおねがいしまーす！
Thank you very much!

184
00:26:01,420 --> 00:26:04,050
[Title: 今はいいんだよ。]
[Title: It's Fine Now.]

185
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:17,480
朝が怖くて起きられない 努力はそんなに向いてない
Mornings are scary and I can't wake up / Effort isn't really my thing

186
00:26:18,260 --> 00:26:23,800
泣くことだけが得意になる そんな日々の狭間で
Becoming only good at crying / In between days like that

187
00:26:24,050 --> 00:26:29,530
ちょっとだけ疲れたんだって 星の輝きがしんどくて
Saying I'm just a little tired / The starlight is exhausting

188
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:35,000
言えないことだけ増えてって うつむくように
Only things I can't say keep increasing / Hanging my head down

189
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:42,640
明日が明日が来なければ そしたらきっと楽になれる 空っぽなのに心が痛むんだ
If tomorrow, if tomorrow didn't come / Then I'd surely be relieved / Even though I'm empty, my heart hurts

190
00:26:46,460 --> 00:26:53,750
今日がどうにも寂しくってさ 眠れないままだけどさ
Today is somehow so lonely / Even though I still can't sleep

191
00:26:53,960 --> 00:27:02,094
いつかシアワセって思えるその日まで 君は君のままでいてよ もう頑張らなくてもいいんだよ
Until that day when I can finally feel happy / Stay just as you are / You don't have to try anymore

192
00:27:02,394 --> 00:27:08,660
過去の夜の涙ひとつ それをやわく持って歩いて行く それだけでいまはいいんだよ
A single tear from nights in the past / Carrying it gently as you walk / Just that is fine for now

193
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:40,050
いつか君が笑えるような歌を歌えるのなら 僕にはなにもないけど歌を歌えるのなら
If I can sing a song that will make you smile someday / Even though I have nothing, if I can sing a song

194
00:27:43,180 --> 00:27:51,780
泣いちゃうくらいの日々の朝 夜は温かくなるよ 君は君のままで笑って
Mornings of days when you almost cry / Nights become warm / Laugh just as you are

195
00:27:52,440 --> 00:28:00,710
今日がどうにも寂しくってさ 眠れないままだけどさ いつかシアワセって思えるその日まで
Today is somehow so lonely / Even though I still can't sleep / Until that day when I can finally feel happy

196
00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:09,210
君は君のままでいてよ もう頑張らなくてもいいんだよ 過去の夜の涙ひとつ
Stay just as you are / You don't have to try anymore / A single tear from nights in the past

197
00:28:09,210 --> 00:28:17,750
それをやわく持って歩いて行く それだけでいまはいいんだよ
Carrying it gently as you walk / Just that is fine for now

198
00:28:33,923 --> 00:28:39,463
制服のねねたち可愛かったよね！次はどの曲にしよう？
The uniform Nene's were so cute! Which song should we do next?

199
00:28:40,553 --> 00:28:43,023
ゲストは次で最後みたい。
The guest seems to be the last one next.

200
00:28:43,183 --> 00:28:46,983
その前に、一回ねねのソロを挟んどく？
Before that, shall we squeeze in a Nene solo once?

201
00:28:48,433 --> 00:28:51,113
よーし！この曲に決定！
Alright! Deciding on this song!

202
00:28:52,887 --> 00:28:58,307
次はアイドル曲だから、アイドルっぽい衣装で歌いたいな。
Next is an idol song, so I want to sing in an idol-like outfit.

203
00:28:58,637 --> 00:29:15,627
どの衣装にしよっかなぁ。あっ、これもいいけど、いやいやこっちでも、いやいやこの服、いやいやこっち！この衣装に、決定ー！
Which outfit should I choose? Ah, this is good too, but no no this one, no no this clothes, no no this! Deciding on this outfit!

204
00:29:16,987 --> 00:29:23,047
着替えますよー！いくぞー！
I'm changing! Here we go!

205
00:29:25,687 --> 00:29:29,927
みんな聞いてねー！
Everyone listen!

206
00:29:38,929 --> 00:29:43,329
絶対アイドル辞めないで ずっと輝いてる君を見たい
Never quit being an idol / I want to see you shining forever

207
00:30:02,221 --> 00:30:04,201
「絶対アイドル 辞めないで!」
"Never stop being an absolute idol!"

208
00:30:05,169 --> 00:30:09,569
私がもし 君のとこ 離れたなら
If I were to ever leave your side,

209
00:30:10,669 --> 00:30:16,069
君はちょっと 寂しくなるかな 意地悪考える
would you feel a bit lonely? How mischievous of you to think so.

210
00:30:16,569 --> 00:30:20,869
好きな人が いるのなら ないしょにしてね
If there's someone you like, keep it a secret from me.

211
00:30:21,269 --> 00:30:27,869
神様は将来と指切りを どこかにたくしてね
Entrust your future promises somewhere to the gods.

212
00:30:28,069 --> 00:30:33,269
君の好きに 合わせ買った 髪の色
The hair color I changed to match your preferences—

213
00:30:34,069 --> 00:30:40,569
私の中 君だけで 感情制御中 セキニンとって 大好きです
you're the only one inside me, emotions under control, take responsibility, I love you!

214
00:30:46,069 --> 00:30:53,569
絶対アイドル 辞めないで! やさしい目も まじめ顔も すべてしめる 私が許せない
Never stop being an absolute idol! Your kind eyes, your serious face, I can't forgive myself holding all of it!

215
00:30:54,069 --> 00:31:00,069
だからそんなで 輝いて! 星の数じゃ かがやかないの まぶしい君が 世界一だよ
So shine brightly like that! It doesn't sparkle among a million stars, you are the number one in the world!

216
00:31:06,069 --> 00:31:13,069
星の数じゃ かがやかないの まぶしい君が 世界一だよ
It doesn't sparkle among a million stars, you are the number one in the world!

217
00:31:26,569 --> 00:31:30,269
君の夢は なんですか 教えてほしい
What is your dream? I want you to tell me.

218
00:31:31,069 --> 00:31:37,569
その夢がアイドルじゃなくても 覚悟はしてるから
Even if that dream isn't an idol, I'm prepared for it.

219
00:31:38,069 --> 00:31:43,569
星のいない空 それが当たり前で
A sky without stars, that's just how it naturally is,

220
00:31:44,069 --> 00:31:49,069
暗い道に迷わずに 飛び出すのもこわかった
and stepping out into the dark path without getting lost was scary too.

221
00:31:49,569 --> 00:31:53,569
そんなとき やっと見えた光
At times like that, the light I finally saw—

222
00:31:57,069 --> 00:32:04,069
絶対君は分かってて この想い言葉分かってても 君はキラキラ一緒に合う
Surely you understand, even if you understand these feelings and words, you sparkle together with me.

223
00:32:10,569 --> 00:32:17,569
絶対大きなステージで 後悔しても前で感じたい 今日の歌い方 なんか好きだな
On a definitely huge stage, even with regrets, I want to feel ahead. Somehow I like today's way of singing.

224
00:32:24,569 --> 00:32:29,869
君の努力 私の愛 成り立つこの関係
Your hard work and my love—this relationship stands upon them.

225
00:32:30,069 --> 00:32:41,569
は強くって もろいの 星の幸せを 願ったけど だけど だって君はアイドルよ
It's strong yet fragile. I wished for your happiness, but still, after all, you are an idol!

226
00:32:46,069 --> 00:32:53,569
初めて目があったから 今日も明日も君ばかりだ
Because our eyes met for the first time, today and tomorrow it's all about you!

227
00:32:55,569 --> 00:33:00,069
絶対アイドル 辞めないで これをぬくもれないおとぎ話
Never stop being an absolute idol! A heartwarming fairy tale beyond this—

228
00:33:01,069 --> 00:33:10,069
恋よりもっと好きな 魔法よ解けないままで
A magic even more beloved than love, remaining unbroken.

229
00:33:34,477 --> 00:33:35,507
うわっ!
Whoa!

230
00:33:35,927 --> 00:33:38,327
ねねの新衣装 どうだった?
How was Nene's new outfit?

231
00:33:38,907 --> 00:33:41,597
最後の一曲の曲選んじゃう!
I'll choose the last song!

232
00:33:42,297 --> 00:33:45,457
よーし、この曲に決定!
Alright, I've decided on this song!

233
00:33:47,417 --> 00:33:54,747
今日は、おまるんがいないから、おまるんの曲をね、ボラボで歌っていきたいと思います!
Today, since Omaru-n isn't here, we're going to sing one of Omaru-n's songs as NePoLaBo!

234
00:33:55,407 --> 00:34:05,697
どの衣装で歌おうかな…はい、みんな見たいと思うので、新衣装に決定!選ばせない!
Which outfit should I sing in... Right, since everyone wants to see it, the new outfit is decided! I won't let you choose!

235
00:34:07,577 --> 00:34:09,377
はい、変身します、変身します!
Yes, transforming, transforming!

236
00:34:10,897 --> 00:34:15,617
はい、見て、かわいい!
Yes, look, so cute!

237
00:34:18,569 --> 00:34:20,569
ご覧あれ!
Behold!

238
00:34:25,369 --> 00:34:27,269
ハラハラエブリワン
Heart-pounding everyone,

239
00:34:27,269 --> 00:34:29,869
まもなくオンステージ
coming soon on stage,

240
00:34:29,869 --> 00:34:32,569
台風一過にご挨拶 さあ始めよう
post-typhoon greetings, now let's begin!

241
00:34:45,369 --> 00:34:47,469
ようこそパーティーナイト
Welcome to party night,

242
00:34:47,469 --> 00:34:51,569
誰かが語る 連日満員御礼 どうぞお引きに
someone speaks, daily packed houses, please draw close.

243
00:34:51,569 --> 00:34:54,069
待ってたショウタイム
We've been waiting for showtime,

244
00:34:54,069 --> 00:34:58,269
誰かが語る どうでもいいような顔を見せてよね
someone speaks, show me some indifferent face or another.

245
00:34:59,069 --> 00:35:00,186
クソ野郎共が
You bastards—

246
00:35:00,234 --> 00:35:03,367
戦略幕が明けたそのオノマトペ群がる人形は
The curtain of strategy has risen, those onomatopoeia-swarming dolls...

247
00:35:03,367 --> 00:35:06,117
ピエロに口づけを
give a kiss to the clown.

248
00:35:06,217 --> 00:35:09,617
今日も大団円 脚本家が笑う
Today is a grand finale, the scriptwriter laughs,

249
00:35:09,617 --> 00:35:13,317
騙されてくれるあなたと
being fooled along with you.

250
00:35:13,317 --> 00:35:16,317
新しい今ここで何を隠してる？
What are you hiding in this new "now"?

251
00:35:18,617 --> 00:35:21,417
戦略幕が明けたそのオノマトペ
The curtain of strategy has risen, that onomatopoeia

252
00:35:21,417 --> 00:35:25,317
群がる人形はピエロに口づけを
and the swarming dolls give a kiss to the clown.

253
00:35:25,417 --> 00:35:28,917
本日大団円 脚本家が笑う
Today's grand finale, the scriptwriter laughs,

254
00:35:28,917 --> 00:35:31,617
騙されてくれるあなたと
being fooled along with you.

255
00:35:31,617 --> 00:35:35,617
新しい今ここで何を考えてる？
What are you thinking in this new "now"?

256
00:35:50,217 --> 00:35:53,317
耳をくんずほぐれつ拍手喝采
Entangled ears, thunderous applause,

257
00:35:53,317 --> 00:35:56,617
カルマおどれば人にもなれる
if karma dances, even you can become human.

258
00:35:56,617 --> 00:35:59,917
フォーカスされた日常 恐れを抱いて
Embracing the fear of a focused everyday life,

259
00:35:59,917 --> 00:36:03,117
侵食するように
like an erosion...

260
00:36:03,317 --> 00:36:06,117
1回 2回 3回 嘘を重ねて
One time, two times, three times, stacking lies,

261
00:36:06,117 --> 00:36:09,917
10回 100回 1000回 瞳を逸らして
10 times, 100 times, 1000 times, looking away,

262
00:36:10,117 --> 00:36:15,617
春なんだったけかな 私たちは
What was spring again, for us?

263
00:36:16,317 --> 00:36:23,117
怯えたりした仮面もたい ひとりぼっちのワルツでお迎え
Welcoming with a lonely waltz the masks that trembled.

264
