Mama, holding me for the very first time...

319
00:47:44,365 --> 00:47:47,025
気持ちはどうだった？
how did you feel?

320
00:47:47,525 --> 00:47:52,565
パパ私が 生まれた日は
Papa, on the day I was born...

321
00:47:52,925 --> 00:47:56,085
嬉しかった？
were you happy?

322
00:47:56,505 --> 00:48:05,765
あれから奇跡を重ねて 私なりの愛も 出会いも 育ててゆきたい
Accumulating miracles ever since, I want to nurture my own love and encounters.

323
